candidate_text:
Position: Backend Node.js & React Software Engineer
Moreinfo: I'm a Full-Stack developer. I develop web applications using React.js and Node.js frameworks, Redux Toolkit and Firebase.
Duties/responsibilities: Front-end and Back-end development.

My Pet projects:
   – WebCrafters (HTML, CSS) — a multipage website with responsive design;
   – ContactKeeper (React.js, Redux Toolkit) — An application with registration and account for storing contacts.
  – Movies App — An application with new movies. The website offers movie searches, cast lists, and reviews.
  – Mobile PicShare (React Native, Firebase) — The app creates a Photo Collection for mobile devices.

Team projects:
   – IceCream (HTML, CSS, SASS, JS, Parcel) — a website of an ice cream company with responsive design, burger menu, modal window and attractive design;
   – Filmoteka (HTML, CSS, SASS, JavaScript, REST API, Parcel, Firebase) — a project that allows users to search for movies and add them to their own library.

On a team project, I took on the role of Scrum Master and practiced the Agile philosophy. I like working in the Scrum concept.
My goal is to continue to develop in my profession and help the team achieve common goals.
Looking For: I want to join the creation of new and exciting projects together with an energetic and friendly team of engineers.
My aspiration is to constantly improve and expand my knowledge to solve complex and diverse problems using different technologies and programming stacks.
I want to be a part of the company and feel that my actions are beneficial and help it grow.
Highlights: I have a pretty strong technical background. I have gone from creating a simple website on tables, developing and implementing websites on different CMSs with different developers to a professional understanding of Java Script.
Relevant experience:
  – Designing the structure of the future site;
  – improving UX/UI design;
  – writing technical specifications for developers;
  – development of design for desktop and mobile versions;
  – creating a semantic core;
  – optimization of the website for search engines (SEO)
  – interaction with hosting;
  – Scrum master on a team project;
  – 2 Pet-projects from the time of study.

I have an analytical mindset and the ability to self-learn.
