Highlights:
Working as org consultant, agile coach, catalyst, change agent and servant leader who provides professional coaching, facilitation, teaching and mentoring closely 
C-level, Engineering Managers, VP of Engineering, Teams to help organization realize it's full potential, growing skillset, technical excellence and achieve excellent results across the board.

Got through full scale Russian invasion without loosing a single person and returned back to the pre-war performance level or sometimes even higher after only 2 sprints. Took care about people with additional checkups, relocation help, equipment help, psychological, moral and emotional support.

Established: 
- Continuous improvement cycle with team of Scrum Masters using OKR framework as a baseline;
- Monthly Leadership retrospective;
- Unique metrics such as predictability for business and team health monitor;
- Thorough and fast Onboarding process that mitigates risks of of loosing people, lack of knowledge, lack of engagement and lack of collaboration;
- Value streams (aka Investment Areas) including cross-cutting backlog;
- User personas as a main reference in User Stories;
- Automation QA expertise (Moved from pure manual approach to automation and CI\CD);
- Hackathon;
As an outstanding achievement raised $130 Million in Series B funding! 
Worked with 14 cross-functional cross-cultural teams in US, Ukraine, India and Latin America building robust technology, optimizing wastes, transfer knowledge, eliminating blockers, giving resources, hiring talents and growing network of shippers and carriers, creating truly collaborative environment for spot and contract procurement in logistics domain.

Unlike traditional project management i am consulting, living by, and working through Agile values, principles and practices. 

Aiming to reduce dependencies and increase collaboration. 
Driving results by focusing on developing the capabilities of the people and teams over optimizing for immediate, short-term results.

Certified Professional Agile Leader
Certified Agile Coach
Certified Scrum Master
Certified Advanced Test Manager
Speaker and a host for "Testing Stage" conference.
Certified trainer in "Codespace"

